│                                                                    │
│  1 Do we need more context?                                        │
│    No. The issue is rooted in Django's handling of TextChoices and │
│    CharField's __str__ method. The core problem is that the        │
│    __str__ method of the CharField is not converting the enum      │
│    value to a string, leading to the failure in the test. This     │
│    behavior is expected in Django when using TextChoices, but the  │
│    test case expects the string representation of the enum value.  │
│  2 Bug locations:                                                  │
│     • Location 1: File: testing/pkg/models.py, Class: MyObject,    │
│       Method: __str__                                              │
│       Intended behavior: The __str__ method of MyObject should     │
│       return the string representation of my_str_value, which is a │
│       CharField with choices=MyChoice.choices. This should return  │
│       the string value of the enum (e.g., "first") instead of the  │
│       enum instance itself.                                        │
│     • Location 2: File: django/db/models/fields/char.py, Class:    │
│       CharField, Method: __str__                                   │
│       Intended behavior: The __str__ method of CharField should    │
│       return the string representation of the value stored in the  │
│       field, which is the string value of the enum (e.g., "first") │
│       rather than the enum instance itself.                        │
│                                                                    │
│ Resolution:                                                        │
│ The issue arises because Django's CharField does not explicitly    │
│ convert the enum value to a string when using choices=TextChoices. │
│ To fix this, the __str__ method of CharField should be modified to │
│ return the string representation of the value, ensuring it matches │
│ the expected behavior in the test case.                            │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
