│       Intended behavior: The __str__ method of CharField should    │
│       return the string representation of the value stored in the  │
│       field. If the field's value is an enum instance (e.g.,       │
│       MyChoice.FIRST_CHOICE), the method should return the string  │
│       value (e.g., "first") instead of the enum instance itself.   │
│     • Location 2: File: testing/pkg/models.py, Class: MyObject,    │
│       Method: __str__                                              │
│       Intended behavior: The __str__ method of MyObject should     │
│       return the string representation of my_str_value, which is a │
│       CharField with choices=MyChoice.choices. This should return  │
│       the string value of the enum (e.g., "first") instead of the  │
